 "emoji": "⚓",
 "sentences": [
  "Three Italian dreadnoughts formed the Conte di Cavour class in the 1910s.",
  "They ferried 138,000 Serbian infantry across the Adriatic in 87 trips.",
  "These ships also carried 13,000 cavalrymen and 10,000 horses to Corfu.",
  "Leonardo da Vinci sank from a magazine explosion in 1916.",
  "The two survivors were extensively reconstructed between 1933 and 1937.",
  "Both ships later participated in the Battle of Calabria in July 1940."
